/* DATA DESCRIPTION:
Citation:	Bange, Hermann W; Nachtigall, Kerstin; Hansen, Levka; Hepach, Helmke; Qelaj, Kastriot; Malien, Frank (2025): Chlorophyll a data from the Boknis Eck time series station 2015 to 2021 [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.976764
Abstract:	The dataset was acquired at the time-series station Boknis Eck (54.5°N and 10.0°E) at six standard depths (1, 5, 10, 15, 20, 25 m). The dataset contains data for Chlorophyll a (sampled with a rosette sampler, measured using a fluorometer until 2019 and using high performance liquid chromatography from 2019). The data are from 2015 to 2021.
Keyword(s):	Baltic Sea; Boknis Eck; chlorophyll-a; Time-Series Data
Project(s):	DAM sustainMare - CREATE: Concepts for Reducing the Effects of Anthropogenic pressures and uses on marine Ecosystems and on Biodiversity (CREATE)
	Research Mission of the German Marine Research Alliance (DAM): Protection and sustainable use of marine areas (sustainMare) (URI: https://www.sustainmare.de/index.php.en)
Funding:	Federal Ministry of Education and Research (BMBF) (URI: https://www.bmbf.de/), grant/award no. 03F0910F: DAM sustainMare - CREATE, GEOMAR (URI: https://foerderportal.bund.de/foekat/jsp/SucheAction.do?actionMode=view&fkz=03F0910F)
Coverage:	LATITUDE: 54.529500 * LONGITUDE: 10.039300
	DATE/TIME START: 2015-01-06T09:54:24 * DATE/TIME END: 2021-12-01T09:00:00
	MINIMUM DEPTH, water: 1 m * MAXIMUM DEPTH, water: 25 m
Event(s):	Boknis_Eck_1957 * LATITUDE: 54.529500 * LONGITUDE: 10.039330 * DATE/TIME: 1957-04-30T00:00:00 * LOCATION: Boknis Eck * METHOD/DEVICE: CTD/Rosette (CTD-RO)
Parameter(s):	DATE/TIME (Date/Time) * GEOCODE * PI: Bange, Hermann W (https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4053-1394, hbange@geomar.de, https://www.geomar.de/hbange/)
	LATITUDE (Latitude) * GEOCODE * PI: Bange, Hermann W (https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4053-1394, hbange@geomar.de, https://www.geomar.de/hbange/)
	LONGITUDE (Longitude) * GEOCODE * PI: Bange, Hermann W (https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4053-1394, hbange@geomar.de, https://www.geomar.de/hbange/)
	DEPTH, water [m] (Depth water) * GEOCODE * PI: Bange, Hermann W (https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4053-1394, hbange@geomar.de, https://www.geomar.de/hbange/)
	Cast number (Cast) * PI: Bange, Hermann W (https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4053-1394, hbange@geomar.de, https://www.geomar.de/hbange/)
